---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title={`About - ${SITE_TITLE}`}
      description="About the Tinycord project"
    />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-surface text-primary">
    <Header />

    <main class="prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
      <div class="not-prose">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight m-0 mb-8 text-primary">
          About Tinycord
        </h1>
      </div>

      <p>
        Tinycord is a minimal, fast, and secure alternative to the official
        Discord desktop client. It wraps Discord's web app in a lightweight
        native WebView instead of bundling an entire Chromium runtime like
        Electron-based clients do.
      </p>

      <h2>Why?</h2>
      <p>
        The official Discord client is built on Electron, which bundles a full
        Chromium browser (~200 MB). Tinycord uses your system's native WebView
        (WKWebView on macOS, WebKitGTK on Linux, WebView2 on Windows),
        resulting in a binary under 5 MB with less memory usage and faster
        startup.
      </p>

      <h2>Tech</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Language:</strong> Zig 0.14</li>
        <li>
          <strong>WebView:</strong> zig-webview via a custom fork for macOS
          media support
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Build:</strong> Zig build system, GoReleaser for
          cross-platform releases
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Tinycord does not collect any telemetry, analytics, or usage data. It
        has no background processes, no auto-updater, and no bundled ads.
        Microphone and camera access are requested only when needed for
        voice/video calls and can be revoked at any time via system settings.
      </p>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
